NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across Cardiff — a complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**. No upfront costs, no technical headaches.

## A professional Cardiff website without the hassle

Whether you're a sole trader in Canton, a service business in Roath, or a start-up in the city centre — a Managed Starter Website gets you online quickly with a professional result and zero ongoing effort on your part.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We also add new pages to your site every month, giving it more content and more chances to rank on Google.

## Plans from £20/month inc. VAT

- **Starter — £20/month inc. VAT** — 5 new pages added per month
- **Growth — £35/month inc. VAT** — 10 new pages added per month
- **Scale — £50/month inc. VAT** — unlimited new pages added per month

All tiers include the full managed website package. See our [managed starter websites service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) for full details.

## Why choose a managed website for your Cardiff business?

Cardiff is a competitive market — but most small businesses don't have the time or budget for a full custom build. A Managed Starter Website gives you a credible, growing online presence at a fraction of the cost, with none of the ongoing maintenance burden.

## Frequently asked questions

**How quickly can my site go live?**

Most sites are live within 5–7 days of receiving your details and content.

**Can I make changes?**

Yes — small content updates are included. Just get in touch and we'll handle it.

**Is there a contract?**

There's a minimum 6-month term, then rolling monthly with 30 days' notice.

